      "note": "The two transitions into FINALIZED are declared requires_out_of_corpus, and this engine holds no authority to perform any transition at all. The ceiling is therefore enforced structurally: no edit to this declaration can produce a FINALIZED record, because a record's state must also be located in the act that determined it. CEP-007 III.2 nevertheless admits PROVISIONAL to the freeze lifecycle, so the ceiling caps finality without blocking freeze.",
